# XMB entry-point watch for the capture RPCS3 (local, not upstream). Applies on top of rpcs3-xmb-trace.patch.
# XMB_PC_TRACE=<file> XMB_PC_WATCH=<hex,...> logs r3..r8, f1..f4, lr, the stack back chain and the RSX flip/vblank
# counters at taken b/bl/bcctr to the watched guest addresses. XMB_PC_WATCH_PRX=<module name> makes the watch values
# offsets from that PRX's first segment (rebased when it loads; PRX bases move between runs). XMB_PC_DUMP=
# <reg>,<deref|->,<off>,<count>;... (hex) logs count words at gpr[reg] (+deref read as a pointer) + off per hit.
# PPU interpreter only (PPU Decoder: Interpreter (static)). Used by audit/PAGE-MOVE.md and audit/PARTICLES.md 2026-11-05.
